%N A401335 Decimal expansion of -Sum_{n>=0} (-1)^n*((2*n+1)^(1/(2*n+1)) - 1).
%C A401335 The analog of the MRB constant A037077 over the odd numbers, i.e., -Sum_{n>=1} chi(n)*(n^(1/n) - 1) with chi the nonprincipal Dirichlet character modulo 4 (A101455).
%F A401335 Equals beta'(1) - Sum_{k>=2} ((-1)^k/k!) * beta^(k)(k), where beta is the Dirichlet beta function and beta'(1) = (Pi/4)*(gamma + 2*log(2) + 3*log(Pi) - 4*log(Gamma(1/4))).
%e A401335 0.235385473121246179920957401697473508203745994580195667443237105987065074935877062962939576...
%o A401335 (PARI) \p 130
%o A401335 -suminf(k = 1, (-1)^k * lfun(-4, k, k)/k!)
%o A401335 (PARI) default(realprecision, 120); sumalt(k=0, (-1)^(k+1) * ((2*k+1)^(1/(2*k+1)) - 1)) \\ _Vaclav Kotesovec_, Oct 28 2026
